<item><title>Contract 26/27 Passchendaele Cycleway Renewal</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the renewal of the Passchendaele Cycleway at three individual sections north of the Fernside Road / Lineside Road intersection.<br /><br />The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />- Renewal of approximately 410 metres of 2.5-metre-wide asphalt cycleway, noting that the project is split into two Separable Portions consisting of:<br /><br /> - Separable Portion One: approximately 200m of cycleway renewal <br /><br /> - Separable Portion Two: approximately 210m of cycleway renewal <br /><br />Approval of Separable Portion Two is dependent on budget availability and has a high likelihood of not proceeding.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 04/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2698<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Aimee Hurley Email: aimee.hurley@wmk.govt.nz Tel: 0272716320<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
